WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
An offshore handoff should carry
an artifact and a named next owner.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:07.680
Product and domain reviewers
approve the behavior.

00:00:07.736 --> 00:00:10.960
Engineers draft, review
and execute the case.

00:00:11.093 --> 00:00:14.880
Platform owners provide
the pinned runner, reset procedure

00:00:14.980 --> 00:00:19.520
and evidence retention.
The proposed pilot team includes a lead,

00:00:19.577 --> 00:00:24.280
domain testers, automation engineers
and an environment specialist.

00:00:24.427 --> 00:00:26.560
Rejected work returns to its author.

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:29.600
Missing evidence
or an unresolved payment defect

00:00:29.707 --> 00:00:32.560
holds the affected scope
until ownership is clear.
